### Listar contas com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/account?registers=10&page=1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter todas as contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/all
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter conta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/{{idAccount}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Criar conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/account
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Conta de teste",
  "email": "{{accountEmail}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Atualizar conta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/account
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{idAccount}}",
  "name": "Conta de teste atualizada"
}

### Atualizar minha conta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/updatemyaccount
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Meu nome atualizado"
}

### Vincular dashboard à conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/dashboard/add
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "idAccount": "{{idAccount}}",
  "idDashboard": "{{idDashboard}}"
}

### Remover dashboard da conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/dashboard/remove
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "idAccount": "{{idAccount}}",
  "idDashboard": "{{idDashboard}}"
}

### Vincular perfil à conta na empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/profile/add
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "idAccount": "{{idAccount}}",
  "idCompany": "{{idCompany}}",
  "idProfile": {{idProfile}}
}

### Remover perfil da conta na empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/profile/remove
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "idAccount": "{{idAccount}}",
  "idCompany": "{{idCompany}}",
  "idProfile": {{idProfile}}
}

### Excluir conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/account/{{idAccount}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}
